<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202606100939-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.24355%2Fdbbs.084-202606100939-0>.
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202606100939-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Thermogravimetric decomposition data for black cast pmma: the effect of sample size".
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202606100939-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The dataset comprises thermogravimetric analysis data for black cast PMMA under non-isothermal and isothermal conditions. The focus is on the influence of the particle size used in the experiments.".
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202606100939-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202606100939-0".
