<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202408301329-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.24355%2Fdbbs.084-202408301329-0>.
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202408301329-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Simulation setups, results and software for the publication high fidelity numerical modelling of european brushwood groyne fluid-structure-interaction: parametrization through darcy-forchheimer, reflection and transmission coefficients".
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202408301329-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Dataset on the publication \\'High fidelity numerical modelling of European brushwood groyne fluid-structure-interaction: Parametrization through Darcy-Forchheimer, reflection and transmission coefficients\\' (https://doi.org/10.1016/j.coastaleng.2024.104659) containing all analysed water surface elevations, post-processed quantities and REEF3D software code applied in the publication.".
