<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202312071717-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.24355%2Fdbbs.084-202312071717-0>.
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202312071717-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Gc-ms datasets".
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202312071717-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Untreated NEO and AD Monocytes (each n = 3) were cultivated in U-[13C]-glucose tracer medium and isotopic enrichment determined after 24h using GC–MS.".
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202312071717-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202312071717-0".
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202312071717-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2025"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
