<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202401090827-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.24355%2Fdbbs.084-202401090827-0>.
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202401090827-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Corporate greenhouse gas accounting for emissions from electricity consumption: code accompanying the dissertation".
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202401090827-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This repository contains all the code and data used for producing the results documented in the dissertation titled \\'Corporate greenhouse gas emissions accounting for emissions from electricity consumption\\' by the same author.".
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202401090827-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202401090827-0".
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202401090827-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2024"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
