<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202504170956-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.24355%2Fdbbs.084-202504170956-0>.
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202504170956-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Thermogravimetric and microscale calorimeter data on cast pmma (version 1.0)".
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202504170956-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Please use the latest version 2.0 of the data set available under: https://doi.org/10.24355/dbbs.084-202508070641-0 Thermogravimetric analyses (TGA) and micro-scale combustion calorimeter (MCC) experiments were carried out for a study on influences on micro-scale experiments in the context of kinetic modelling of the decomposition of cast polymethyl methacrylate (PMMA). Two different sample configurations (preparation methods) were used for the experiments: pieces and powder.".
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202504170956-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202504170956-0".
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202504170956-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2025"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
