<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202504170956-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.24355/dbbs.084-202504170956-0>.
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202504170956-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/temporal> _:leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202504170956-0.
