<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202503121521-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202503121521-0".
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202503121521-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2025"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202503121521-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/leopard>.
