<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202606211131-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.24355%2Fdbbs.084-202606211131-0>.
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202606211131-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Dataset on the publication: design and fabrication of structures with graphic statics and augmented reality".
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202606211131-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains supplementary documentation for the publication: Hack, N., Xiao, Y., Jantzen, C., Tesche, J., Mawas, K., Gerke, M., D\\'Acunto, P., 2024, August. Design and Fabrication of Structures with Graphic Statics and Augmented Reality. In Proceedings of IASS Annual Symposia, IASS 2024 Zurich Symposium: Computational Methods – Next Generation Parametric Design, pp. 1–9. Cham: International Association for Shell and Spatial Structures (IASS). The dataset includes CAD files from the design process as well as photographic documentation.".
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202606211131-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202606211131-0".
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202606211131-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
