<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202309131139-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.24355%2Fdbbs.084-202309131139-0>.
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202309131139-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Method to calculate high resolution grid emission factors: focus on methodological aspects".
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202309131139-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This code allows users to calculate a grid emission factor at a high temporal resolution (15 minutes), based on publicly available data. Together with the referenced dataset, it belongs to the publication (https://doi.org/10.1039/D3EE04394K). The current version of the code can be found on GitHub (https://github.com/malteschaefer1/EFmethodmadness).".
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202309131139-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202309131139-0".
<http://localhost:5002/leo-doi-10-24355-dbbs-084-202309131139-0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2024"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
